<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About - GNITC Portal</title>
    <link
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css"
      rel="stylesheet" />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css" />
    <style>
      body {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
      }
      .feature-icon {
        width: 48px;
        height: 48px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="navbar navbar-light bg-white shadow-sm mb-5">
      <div class="container">
        <a class="navbar-brand fw-bold text-primary" href="/student-login">
          <i class="bi bi-mortarboard-fill me-2"></i>GNITC Portal
        </a>
        <a
          href="javascript:history.back()"
          class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">
          <i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i> Back
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container pb-5" style="max-width: 800px">
      <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <h1 class="fw-bold text-dark">About The Portal</h1>
        <p class="text-muted fs-5">
          A next-generation campus management system.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 mb-4">
        <h4 class="fw-bold mb-4">The Project</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary mb-4">
          This University Portal was developed to streamline academic management
          at Guru Nanak Institutions Technical Campus. It provides students and
          faculty with a unified, real-time dashboard to track attendance,
          monitor fee dues, and manage extracurricular club and event
          registrations.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mb-3 mt-4">Tech Stack</h5>
        <div class="row g-3">
          <div class="col-md-6 d-flex align-items-center">
            <div
              class="feature-icon bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success me-3">
              <i class="bi bi-server"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Backend</h6>
              <small class="text-muted">Node.js & Express</small>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6 d-flex align-items-center">
            <div
              class="feature-icon bg-primary bg-opacity-10 text-primary me-3">
              <i class="bi bi-database"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Database</h6>
              <small class="text-muted">MongoDB & Mongoose</small>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6 d-flex align-items-center">
            <div
              class="feature-icon bg-warning bg-opacity-10 text-warning me-3">
              <i class="bi bi-filetype-html"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Frontend</h6>
              <small class="text-muted">EJS Templating</small>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-6 d-flex align-items-center">
            <div
              class="feature-icon bg-purple text-purple me-3"
              style="background-color: #f3e8ff; color: #7e22ce">
              <i class="bi bi-bootstrap"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">UI Framework</h6>
              <small class="text-muted">Bootstrap 5</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 bg-primary text-white">
        <div
          class="d-flex flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center text-center text-md-start">
          <div class="me-md-4 mb-3 mb-md-0">
            <div
              class="bg-white text-primary rounded-circle d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"
              style="width: 80px; height: 80px; font-size: 2.5rem">
              <i class="bi bi-person-fill"></i>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h6 class="text-white-50 text-uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">
              Developed By
            </h6>
            <h3 class="fw-bold mb-1">Hari Prasad Goud</h3>
            <p class="mb-2 opacity-75">
              B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering
            </p>
            <div
              class="d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-md-start gap-3 mt-3">
              <a
                href="#"
                class="btn btn-light btn-sm rounded-pill px-3 fw-bold text-primary"
                ><i class="bi bi-github me-1"></i> GitHub</a
              >
              <a
                href="#"
                class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm rounded-pill px-3 fw-bold"
                ><i class="bi bi-linkedin me-1"></i> LinkedIn</a
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
